/* Test data                                                                  */
/******************************************************************************/

::Resource Basic
# Test

```rexx
Say "Hello, world!"
```

Done.
::END

::Resource NonRexx
```python
print('hello')
```
::END

::Resource Multiple
```rexx
Say 1
```
Middle text
```rexx
Say 2
```
::END

::Resource Twiddles
~~~rexx
Nop
~~~
::END

::Resource Extended
````rexx
Nop
````
::END

::Resource StyleLight
```rexx {style=light}
Nop
```
::END

::Resource PlainBlock
```rexx
Nop
```
::END

::Resource NumberLines
```rexx {.numberLines}
Say 1
Say 2
```
::END

::Resource Caption
```rexx {caption="My listing"}
Say 1
```
::END

::Resource Executor
```executor
Nop
```
::END

::Resource Nested
````markdown
```rexx
Say 'nested'
```
````
::END

::Resource MissingEnd
```rexx
Say 1
::END

::Resource BadOption
```rexx {bogus=value}
Nop
```
::END

::Resource BadRexx
```rexx
Say ((
```
::END

::Resource EmptyBlock
```rexx
```
::END

::Resource Indented
- A bullet

  ```rexx
  Say "indented"
  ```

  - After the block
::END

::Resource DeepIndent
- Level 1

  - Level 2

    - Level 3

      ```rexx
      Say "deep"
      ```
::END

::Resource IndentedTwiddles
- A bullet

  ~~~rexx
  Nop
  ~~~
::END
::Resource TabClose
- A bullet

  ```rexx
  Nop
	```

  Tail text
::END

::Resource ProseMethod
We call `Bark`{.rexx-method} here.
::END

::Resource ProseVar
We use `foo`{.rexx-var} here.
::END

::Resource ProseDirective
The `::METHOD`{.rexx-directive} directive creates a method.
::END

::Resource ProseAroundFence
Before the fence: `Bark`{.rexx-method}.

```rexx
Nop
```

After the fence: `foo`{.rexx-var}.
::END

::Resource ProseUseDefinitionMatch
In prose: `Bark`{.rexx-method}.

```rexx
::Method Bark
  Nop
```
::END

::Resource ProseDoubledBacktick
A span with an inner backtick: ``a`b``{.rexx-var}.
::END

::Resource ProseEscapedSpan
Not a mention: ``Bark`{.rexx-method}`` stays literal.
::END

::Resource ProseTypo
An unpublished name: `x`{.rexx-clas} stays as written.
::END

::Resource ProseUnclosedSpan
No closing backtick: `Bark{.rexx-method} here.
::END

::Resource ProsePinnedStyle
Pinned to light: `foo`{.rexx-var:light}.
::END

::Resource ProseAdjacentMentions
Back to back: `Bark`{.rexx-method}`foo`{.rexx-var} no space.
::END

::Resource ProsePlainCode
Ordinary code: `plain code` with no attribute.
::END

::Resource ProseNoBacktick
Plain prose, nothing special here.
::END

